 config('move',[2],[],0,'Two complete reciprocal running strides in place. Both original legs alternate contact, loading, passing and extension; leg currently forward passes back while the other advances, then exchange again and return to exact supplied contact. Right hand retains compact jar low near ribs, left empty hand swings naturally; cloak and belt follow gait. No sliding root, repeated same-leg step, floating boots or released jars.',2026100801)
 config('attack',[17,7,4,5,6],[[22,1],[40,2],[60,3],[82,4]],0,'One physical RIGHT fist punch and recovery. First put held jar securely into the belt, showing both empty hands, left fist protects chest while right fist winds back near shoulder; drive right forearm and clenched right fist toward screen right with planted lead boot, retract same right fist to ribs and recover guard. Retrieve the original compact jar into right ready hand at the end. No jar strike or throw, no weapon or third hand. Preserve three belt jars.',2026100802)
 config('hit',[17,9],[[32,1]],0,'One clear brief impact recoil and recovery. Chest and head lean backward, both knees flex, left empty hand pulls toward ribs, right hand retains its compact original jar. Recover by bending knees and bringing torso and hands naturally to ready. No falling, throwing, third arm or jar duplication.',2026100803)
 config('defend',[17,7,8],[[30,1]],2,'One defense transition. Stow held right-hand jar securely at belt before raising TWO empty fists in front of forehead and chest; flex knees into supplied low crouched guard and HOLD through final frame. Both original hands remain closed and protective, all original belt jars intact. No throwing, releasing, return to idle or extra hands.',2026100804)
 config('ranged',[17,10,11,12,13],[[22,1],[44,2],[60,3],[82,4]],0,'ONE overarm jar throw and recovery. Original RIGHT hand draws compact corked round peat jar, cocks it behind shoulder with bent elbow, LEFT empty arm aims forward. Throw with RIGHT arm extending toward screen right, original fingers open ONCE and hand becomes empty. Then retract empty right arm and retrieve next original jar from belt to return to ready. Game owns projectile flight: do not draw a flying jar, stream, explosion or smoke outside hand. No repeated throw, magical beam, change of jar size, extra arm or hand swap.',2026100805)
 config('death',[17,16],[],1,'One continuous knee buckle, descent and side collapse. Both knees lose support; hips and shoulders tip toward screen right, body rolls naturally into the supplied head-right side-prone corpse with both legs on ground and original left arm forward. Right-hand jar is released beside fallen arm, all jars become dark. Both arms, two legs, cloak and loose jar stay intact and fully grounded, no upright jars floating above corpse, no stand-up recovery.',2026100806)
 config('cast',[17],[],0,'One physical rally signal, no spellcasting or throw. Both boots planted. Original RIGHT hand keeps compact jar low against belt. Original LEFT empty hand rises from ready to shoulder, turns palm outward in a clear stop/rally gesture, holds briefly, then lowers to original ready. Left elbow bends and forearm moves visibly; a brief head nod accompanies gesture. No new props, glow, magic, released jar or extra hands.',2026100807)
 p.write(p.SOURCE_DIR/'runtime_registration.json',dict(unit_id=UID,reference_height=256,output_scale=.5,ground_anchor=[470,480],legacy_action_family_scale=.95,reason='Original legacy ready/action body217px versus reviewed later idle207px. Fixed whole-legacy family conversion preserves relative crouch/corpse anatomy; articulated idle guides unchanged. No per-frame normalization.'))
 p.write(p.SOURCE_DIR/'delivery.json',dict(takes=[n+'_h3_v1' for n in ['move','attack','hit','defend','ranged','death','cast']],preserved_accepted_clips=['idle'],visual_review=dict(status='pending',notes='Solo Peatflare Jarriers seven H3 actions. Review every original action and native phase before publication; preserved articulated eight-pose idle inspected.')))
